WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.870
Animal shelters across the United States

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.280
have started teaching their
cats to give high fives

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.970
to make them more adoptable.

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.630
This is a true thing, it's happening.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.331
They're teaching them, it's kinda cute.

00:00:10.331 --> 00:00:11.800
(audience applauding)

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.433
Yeah, true story, true story.

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:17.160
They found that people are
much more likely to adopt

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.220
a cat that knows how to high five.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.810
That's true, yeah.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.290
As a result people have already been

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.050
adopting the cats in record numbers.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.530
Here's some footage of the new act owners.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.330
It's pretty cool, take a look.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.460
Yes, thank you so much.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.460
I'll see you Monday.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.221
I got the job.

00:00:34.221 --> 00:00:35.609
(hands slapping)

00:00:35.609 --> 00:00:38.369
(audience laughing)

00:00:38.369 --> 00:00:39.780
(hands slapping)
(audience laughing)

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.709
You finished all your broccoli?

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:43.117
Yup.

00:00:43.117 --> 00:00:44.613
Good job!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.010
(hands slapping)

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.960
Oh Hank, I'm almost done.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.682
That's what she said.

00:00:50.682 --> 00:00:52.281
(laughing)

00:00:52.281 --> 00:00:54.831
(hands slapping)

00:00:54.831 --> 00:00:56.760
Go get it.
(dog barking)

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.663
Good boy, you did it.

00:00:58.663 --> 00:00:59.771
(dog barking)

00:00:59.771 --> 00:01:01.311
(hands slapping)
(cat meowing)

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:04.144
(heavy breathing)

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.199
(hands slapping)
(cat meowing)

00:01:09.199 --> 00:01:12.366
(audience applauding)

00:01:22.189 --> 00:01:25.022
If you can grab a still video...

00:01:26.949 --> 00:01:27.920
I feel like if you can just grab a still

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.018
of the cat high fiving the dog, that is...

00:01:30.018 --> 00:01:32.268
(laughing)

00:01:34.879 --> 00:01:39.879
That's the worst damn
puppeteering you will ever see.

00:01:40.047 --> 00:01:42.287
That's just a bottle brush.

00:01:42.287 --> 00:01:43.120
I know.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.759
(audience laughing)

00:01:45.759 --> 00:01:47.750
We just have to be
honest with our audience.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.600
That wasn't good.

